OL,3,AZelensky and US envoys holding Oslo
OL,4,Atalks as Rubio denies withholding
OL,5,Aintelligence
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS special envoy Steve Witkoff and
OL,8,FVolodymyr Zelensky are meeting in Oslo,
OL,9,Fwith relations on the slide between the
OL,10,FUkrainian leader and US President
OL,11,FDonald Trump.
OL,13,FNorwegian Prime Minister Jonas Gahr
OL,14,FStC8re said Zelensky had asked Oslo and
OL,15,Fneighbouring Finland to organise the
OL,16,Ftalks with the US and European allies
OL,17,F"at a critical time for Ukraine".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
