OL,3,AZelensky and US envoys holding Oslo
OL,4,Atalks as Rubio denies withholding
OL,5,Aintelligence
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio
OL,8,Fearlier rejected as "scandalous"
OL,9,Faccusations that Ukrainians were dying
OL,10,Fbecause the US was withholding
OL,11,Fintelligence from Kyiv.
OL,13,FHe was speaking after Zelensky's top
OL,14,Fmilitary adviser Serhii Beskrestnov
OL,15,Ftold the BBC the lack of reliable US
OL,16,Fwarnings - including about ballistic
OL,17,Fmissile launches - meant lives were
OL,18,Fbeing lost.
